{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cardtographer is a stylized 3D-graphics roguelike deckbuilder, in which you choose one or more champions to fight the evil that has overtaken the lands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In an intense genre mix of deckbuilder , RPG, and roguelike, the choosen champions gain gold and experience during their battles with demons, monsters and dragons, while enhancing their decks to ultimately overcome their opposing enemies, which devastate the lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624160/extras/Untitled_000000-ezgif.com-optimize__1_.gif?t=1743188471\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features of the Demo:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 different champion classes all featuring their own deck, each having multiple playing styles and tactics to be discovered</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 150 cards which can be upgraded, crafted and bought after an initial unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose one or more champions, combining their advantages and\u00a0reduce their weaknesses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 25 Map-Events with choices which can lead to positive or negative effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original Music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Worldmaps you can fully progress through</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3624160?t=1743188471","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3624160?t=1743188471","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624160/3150831b4f0a30a63e5fee1edc2149fa5febf020/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743188471","capsule_imagev5":"https://shar